# SEO / AIO / GEO Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web

Playbook: `docs/SEO-GEO-PLAYBOOK.md`

- Every page exports `metadata` (title ≤ 60 chars, description ≤ 155, canonical, OG image)
- Every page has JSON-LD via `components/seo/JsonLd.tsx` (see schema map in playbook)
- Answer-first: each H2 section opens with a 1–2 sentence direct answer
- Facts with dates link to an official source; keep a `lastReviewed` date on compliance pages
- One topic per page; one H1; descriptive H2/H3 matching how people ask questions
- Update `llms.txt` and `sitemap.ts` when a page is added
- Entity names exactly as in the playbook (product, service, founder) — consistent everywhere
- Never name Macrosoft; no unverifiable competitor claims

*SEO/GEO Agent Rules — VFPScanner Web v0.1.0*
